        "original_id": "556eb267-6c0d-57d4-a04a-5d097fa7b210",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katey Sagal, John Ritter\n- Works: Married... with Children, Futurama, 8 Simple Rules\n- Characters: Peggy Bundy, Leela, Cate Hennessy, Paul Hennessy\n- Topics: television roles, sitcom casting\n\nFacts:\n- Katey Sagal is best known for playing Peggy Bundy, Al Bundy’s sarcastic, lazy, bon bon-eating wife, on Married... with Children.\n- From 1999 to 2003, Katey Sagal voiced Leela on the animated science-fiction series Futurama.\n- 8 Simple Rules was originally titled 8 Simple Rules for Dating My Teenage Daughter during its first season.\n- 8 Simple Rules is an American sitcom about middle-class parents Paul Hennessy and Cate Hennessy raising three children.\n- 8 Simple Rules originally starred John Ritter as Paul Hennessy and Katey Sagal as Cate Hennessy.\n- From 2008 to 2013, Katey Sagal again voiced Leela on Futurama.\n- Katey Sagal also starred on 8 Simple Rules as Cate Hennessy.",
